# Appearance — Menu Bar Appearance pane. Presets are 内置样式 (profiles are 预设).
"%@ (not connected)" = "%@（未连接）"
"Angle" = "角度"
"Apply Menu Bar Style" = "应用菜单栏样式"
"Border" = "边框"
"Border and shadow" = "边框和阴影"
"Border color" = "边框颜色"
"Border width" = "边框宽度"
"Choose…" = "选择…"
# Glass variant (Liquid Glass "Clear", Apple: 透明).
"Clear" = "透明"
"Color" = "颜色"
"Corner radius" = "圆角半径"
"Dark menu bar" = "深色菜单栏"
"Different on each display" = "每个显示器不同"
"Displays" = "显示器"
"Draws behind the menu bar; titles, icons and clicks are not affected." = "绘制在菜单栏后面，不影响标题、图标和点按。"
# Preset name.
"Dusk" = "暮色"
"Edit" = "编辑"
# Which display's style the controls below edit.
"Editing" = "正在编辑"
"End color" = "结束颜色"
"File" = "文件"
"Finder" = "访达"
# Preset name.
"Frosted" = "磨砂"
"Full width" = "全宽"
"Glass" = "玻璃"
# Preset name.
"Glass pills" = "玻璃胶囊"
"Gradient" = "渐变"
"Light and dark" = "浅色和深色"
"Light menu bar" = "浅色菜单栏"
"Match system" = "跟随系统"
"Material" = "材质"
"Menu Bar Appearance" = "菜单栏外观"
"On a dark menu bar" = "深色菜单栏上"
"On a light menu bar" = "浅色菜单栏上"
"On displays with a notch, draws the bar in two parts beside it." = "在有刘海的显示器上，在刘海两侧分两段绘制。"
"One color" = "单一颜色"
"One pill around the app menus, one around the status items. Needs Device Control and Data Access to follow the menus." = "App 菜单和状态项各用一个胶囊包围。需要“设备控制和数据访问”权限来跟随菜单。"
"Only the border is drawn. Set its color and width below." = "只绘制边框。可在下方设置其颜色和宽度。"
"Opacity" = "不透明度"
"Open Menu Bar Settings" = "打开菜单栏设置"
"Outline" = "描边"
"Preview" = "预览"
"Preview of the menu bar style" = "菜单栏样式预览"
"Reduce Transparency is on: materials and glass look solid." = "“降低透明度”已开启：材质和玻璃会显示为不透明。"
"Regular" = "常规"
# Preset name.
"Rounded bar" = "圆角栏"
"Same on every display" = "所有显示器相同"
"Shadow" = "阴影"
"Shadow strength" = "阴影强度"
"Shape" = "形状"
# Preset name.
"Soft tint" = "柔和色调"
"Split around the camera housing" = "在摄像头区域两侧分开"
"Start color" = "起始颜色"
"Start from a preset" = "从内置样式开始"
"Style" = "样式"
"Style the Menu Bar" = "设置菜单栏样式"
"Style the menu bar" = "设置菜单栏样式"
# Style kind: draw nothing, keep macOS's own look.
"System" = "系统默认"
"The menu bar hides automatically, so styling is paused. Choose “Never” for “Automatically hide and show the menu bar” in System Settings › Menu Bar to use it." = "菜单栏会自动隐藏，因此样式已暂停。要使用样式，请在“系统设置 › 菜单栏”中将“自动隐藏和显示菜单栏”设为“永不”。"
"The menu bar looks as macOS draws it. Nothing runs." = "菜单栏保持 macOS 绘制的样子，不运行任何内容。"
"Thick" = "厚"
"Thickness" = "厚度"
"Thin" = "薄"
"Tint" = "色调"
"Tint the glass" = "为玻璃着色"
"Two pills" = "两个胶囊"
"Ultra thick" = "超厚"
"Ultra thin" = "超薄"
"macOS picks dark or light menu bar text from your wallpaper. Colors set to “Light and dark” follow that choice." = "macOS 会根据墙纸选择深色或浅色的菜单栏文字。设为“浅色和深色”的颜色会随之变化。"
"style, color, tint, gradient, glass, material, outline, border, shadow, rounded, pills, notch" = "样式, 颜色, 色调, 渐变, 玻璃, 材质, 描边, 边框, 阴影, 圆角, 胶囊, 刘海, 外观"
"“Show menu bar background” is on, so macOS draws its own background and these styles stay hidden. Turn it off in System Settings › Menu Bar." = "“显示菜单栏背景”已开启，macOS 会绘制自己的背景，这些样式不会显示。可在“系统设置 › 菜单栏”中关闭它。"
# Per-desktop (Space) styles. macOS calls Spaces 桌面 in Mission Control ("桌面 1").
"A desktop without its own style uses the display’s style." = "没有单独样式的桌面使用显示器的样式。"
"All desktops" = "所有桌面"
"Desktop" = "桌面"
"Desktop %lld" = "桌面 %lld"
"Desktop %lld (current)" = "桌面 %lld（当前）"
"Desktops can’t be read on this Mac, so styles apply to whole displays." = "无法在这台 Mac 上读取桌面，因此样式应用于整个显示器。"
"Remove this desktop’s style" = "移除此桌面的样式"
# Screen corners.
"Black rounded corners at the top of the desktop, so the menu bar looks separate. Not drawn in full-screen apps." = "在桌面顶部绘制黑色圆角，让菜单栏看起来是独立的。全屏 App 中不绘制。"
"Black rounded corners at the top of the screen, over the ends of the menu bar." = "在屏幕顶部绘制黑色圆角，覆盖菜单栏两端。"
"On every display, also when the menu bar is not styled." = "应用于所有显示器，菜单栏未设置样式时也生效。"
"Round the corners below the menu bar" = "菜单栏下方使用圆角"
"Round the screen corners" = "屏幕使用圆角"
"Screen corners" = "屏幕圆角"
